§ `Regs 77.996 to 77.999 -- Pilot Project No. 24, measures for major changes in economic conditions (March 30, 2025 to October 10, 2026)`

-- Q66. A benefit period beginning June 1, 2025: the Commission may waive the waiting period.
#ASSERT `May the Commission waive my waiting period` (YearMonthDay 2025 6 1) EQUALS TRUE

-- Q66. A benefit period beginning in 2027: outside the period.
#ASSERT `May the Commission waive my waiting period` (YearMonthDay 2027 1 1) EQUALS FALSE

