#ASSERT `What regional rate of unemployment applies to me under Pilot Project No. 24` (YearMonthDay 2025 4 6) 0.05 EQUALS 0.071

-- Q69. A rate of 13.1% is not less than 13.1%: nothing is deemed.
#ASSERT `What regional rate of unemployment applies to me under Pilot Project No. 24` (YearMonthDay 2025 4 6) 0.131 EQUALS 0.131

-- Q70. 35 weeks of regular benefits; 7 of the last 10 years at 30% of the maximum premium: long-tenured.
#ASSERT `Am I a long-tenured worker` 35 TRUE 7 0 EQUALS TRUE

-- Q70. 36 weeks is not less than 36.
#ASSERT `Am I a long-tenured worker` 36 TRUE 7 0 EQUALS FALSE

-- Q71. Begun July 6, 2025, never ended early, long-tenured, paid at least a week: extended by 20 weeks.
#ASSERT `By how many weeks is my benefit period extended under Pilot Project No. 24` TRUE (YearMonthDay 2025 7 6) FALSE (YearMonthDay 2025 7 6) (YearMonthDay 2025 7 1) TRUE TRUE EQUALS 20

-- Q71. Not a long-tenured worker: not extended.
#ASSERT `By how many weeks is my benefit period extended under Pilot Project No. 24` TRUE (YearMonthDay 2025 7 6) FALSE (YearMonthDay 2025 7 6) (YearMonthDay 2025 7 1) FALSE TRUE EQUALS 0

-- Q72. 110 weeks would be held to 104.
#ASSERT `How long can my benefit period be after its extensions under Pilot Project No. 24` (YearMonthDay 2025 7 6) 110 EQUALS JUST 104

-- Q72. A benefit period beginning in 2027: the adaptation does not apply (the Act's s 10(14) governs).
#ASSERT `How long can my benefit period be after its extensions under Pilot Project No. 24` (YearMonthDay 2027 1 3) 110 EQUALS NOTHING

-- Q73. A base of 45 weeks (invented) and an extension: 65.
#ASSERT `How many weeks of regular benefits can I be paid after the extension under Pilot Project No. 24` 45 TRUE EQUALS 65

-- Q74. Extended: the 50-week reference of subsection 12(6) reads as 70.
